MandarinSouth_Text_1:
	.string "The names of MANDARIN NORTH and\n"
	.string "MANDARIN SOUTH are very similar.\p"
	.string "However, both islands are not\n"
	.string "connected in any way.\p"
	.string "The resemblance of both names\n"
	.string "often causes confusion.$"

MandarinSouth_Text_2:
	.string "This town is called MANDARIN\n"
	.string "SOUTH.\p"
	.string "For some reason it has the same\n"
	.string "name as the whole island.$"

MandarinSouth_Text_3:
	.string "Competing in the ORANGE LEAGUE is\n"
	.string "a special challenge.\p"
	.string "You’ll come past lots of towns and\n"
	.string "routes with no member of the\l"
	.string "ORANGE CREW in it.$"

MandarinSouth_Text_4:
	.string "I have lived here almost all my\n"
	.string "life.\p"
	.string "Lots of things have changed, but\n"
	.string "the sea will always stay the same.$"

MandarinSouth_Text_5:
	.string "Do you know PRIMA of the ELITE\n"
	.string "FOUR?\p"
	.string "She’s MANDARIN SOUTH’s best known\n"
	.string "citizen.\p"
	.string "I heard she occasionally battles\n"
	.string "trainers that come by her house.$"

MandarinSouth_Text_6:
	.string "MANDARIN ISLAND SOUTH \n"
	.string "Soil under your Feet$"

MandarinSouth_Text_7:
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "PRIMA’s house is ahead.$"
